{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ACT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"使徒行傳","commonName":"使徒行傳","title":"使徒行傳","order":44,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"f07478fc266bdf2c2e11b77fb0d520d0cede2ba15c61bebb88b2956ba814a7f2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ACT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ACT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1001},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["揀選七人辦理供給的事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，門徒增多，有說希臘話的猶太人向希伯來人發怨言，因為在天天的供給上忽略了他們的寡婦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["十二使徒叫眾門徒來，對他們說：「我們撇下上帝的道去管理飯食，原是不合宜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所以弟兄們，當從你們中間選出七個有好名聲、被聖靈充滿、智慧充足的人，我們就派他們管理這事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但我們要專心以祈禱、傳道為事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大眾都喜悅這話，就揀選了司提反，乃是大有信心、聖靈充滿的人，又揀選腓利、伯羅哥羅、尼迦挪、提門、巴米拿，並進猶太教的安提阿人尼哥拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["叫他們站在使徒面前。使徒禱告了，就按手在他們頭上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝的道興旺起來；在耶路撒冷門徒數目加增的甚多，也有許多祭司信從了這道。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["司提反被捕"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["司提反滿得恩惠、能力，在民間行了大奇事和神蹟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["當時有稱利百地拿會堂的幾個人，並有古利奈、亞歷山大、基利家、亞細亞各處會堂的幾個人，都起來和司提反辯論。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["司提反是以智慧和聖靈說話，眾人敵擋不住，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["就買出人來說：「我們聽見他說謗讟摩西和上帝的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們又聳動了百姓、長老，並文士，就忽然來捉拿他，把他帶到公會去，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["設下假見證，說：「這個人說話，不住地糟踐聖所和律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我們曾聽見他說，這拿撒勒人耶穌要毀壞此地，也要改變摩西所交給我們的規條。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["在公會裏坐着的人都定睛看他，見他的面貌，好像天使的面貌。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ACT/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ACT/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ACT/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}